-- **Site:** [vectorscopeai.com](https://vectorscopeai.com)
+- **Marketing:** [vectorscopeai.com](https://vectorscopeai.com)
+- **App:** [app.vectorscopeai.com](https://app.vectorscopeai.com)
 - **Email:** hello@vectorscopeai.com
